fering, the Court of the Women and hundreds more. Visualize how they lived and worshipped in an unprecedented immersive experience. \n\nExperience the mobile phone version outside of the headset here -  https://immersivehistory.com/projects/#bible-apps", "short_description": "Herod is considered the greatest architect to ever walk the earth and the temple created by the Jews at the time of Jesus is the ultimate testament of a nation and people's faith. In this free roam VR experience, your AI tour guide teaches you about every room on the temple mount - the Holy Place, the Altar of Burnt Offering, the Court of the Women and hundreds more. Visualize how they lived and worshipped in an unprecedented immersive experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immersivehistory.com/privacy-policy-2/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immersive History", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immersivehistory.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY", "EXPLORATION", "EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8260836173972452"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 5, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1191490139790132"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "644445268761403"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2136981816727912"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1293000298401240"}, {"s